OL,3,GNEWSAOpen wounds and eyes that can't
OL,4,Aclose - women warn about cheap bleph
OL,5,Aeyelid surgery
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: Graphic images and
OL,8,Fdescriptions of surgery
OL,10,F"Everyone made it out to be so easy,
OL,11,Fbut my face felt like it was on fire
OL,12,Fand there was a horrible smell of
OL,13,Fburning skin," says Nikita Morgan, as
OL,14,Fshe describes her eyelid surgery.
OL,16,FShe decided to get a blepharoplasty, or
OL,17,Fa "bleph", removing skin from just
OL,18,Fabove the eyes - after seeing videos
OL,19,Fabout it on social media. Even though
OL,20,Fshe was given a local anaesthetic,
OL,21,FNikita felt extreme pain.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
